{
  "about": "Expected values for scripts/verify-evidence.sh: one entry per check, each naming the docs/EVIDENCE.md row it backs (rows) and the record its value comes from (source). Public data only. Values that change over time are checked against a recorded floor (a light-client store's head, a deposit count), printed, or read at the recorded Sepolia block (a check's block field: a vault's g2State or exitCount after an update, a gate's pending update), never pinned to the latest state.",
  "rows": {
    "verifier": "Proofs column, 'real': checked by RISC Zero's verifier 3.1.0 on Sepolia",
    "v4-round-trip": "Round trip: deposit, relayed claim, burn, state update, release (Sepolia vault v4 + our public chain, 2026-11-15)",
    "v5-private-round-trip": "Private round trip: private claim, private burn, release to an address never used before (Sepolia vault v5 + our public chain, 2026-11-16)",
    "v5-unattended": "State updates proved and posted unattended, about every two hours; releases sent by a settlement service (since 2026-11-16)",
    "two-machines": "Two machines proving back-to-back ranges of the state update, both accepted in order (2026-11-17)",
    "lc-public": "RFP-021 light client, public finality path (our public chain, from 2026-11-17, LEZ block 21641)",
    "v6": "A deposit claimed with no attester key: vault v6 and a bridge instance take deposit roots from the RFP-021 light client (2026-11-18)",
    "v6-round-trips": "Two round trips through vault v6, one public and one private, both released (Sepolia vault v6 + our public chain, 2026-11-18)",
    "v6-wallet-claim": "A v6 deposit claimed from the Names Wallet in Basecamp, the fee paid by the v6 relay (one claim, a test build; 2026-11-18)",
    "v7": "A withdrawal paid on 2 of 3 signer keys through a gate anyone can submit to (Sepolia vault v7 + our public chain, 2026-11-18)",
    "v7-equivocation": "A double-signing signer ejected on Sepolia: a second v7 update staged, contested with a real evidence proof, the key ejected and the update cancelled (our own keys, a test-flag signature; 2026-11-18)",
    "lc-handoff": "The handoff-capable light client following Sepolia (from 2026-11-18, LEZ block 23258); its first committee handoff on our public chain, period 1416 to 1417, 2026-11-18",
    "deposit-page": "Deposit page for ordinary Ethereum wallets; takes an LNS name as the destination (live)"
  },
